{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04YV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$g : W \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to W$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Delta_g$", "MATH_0003": "$\\Delta_f$", "MATH_0004": "$q : W \\times_\\mathcal{Y} (\\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X})\n\\to \\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$q$", "MATH_0006": "$W \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0007": "$q$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-lemma-check-property-weak-covering}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b7f589b2b8b9c82421746733547e596e5066516ef5336d40a81c8d733a36938d", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:44560c7f1b36c6510eeb73e898f82c17ac0171630a0bf348d34e0348c591f8fb", "source_text": "Denote <MATH_0001> the base change.\nThen <MATH_0002> is the base change of <MATH_0003> by the morphism\n<MATH_0004>. Since <MATH_0005> is the base\nchange of <MATH_0006> we see that <MATH_0007> is representable by algebraic\nspaces, surjective, flat, and locally of finite presentation. Hence the\nresult follows from\nProperties of Stacks, Lemma\n<REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:14a0e273250026d2bd4a268847cb3afe8ff4d007203539f8f72403c75e242c3f", "unit_id": "tag:06TZ:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04YV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-absolute-separated}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebraic-definition-change-of-base}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-change-of-base-separated}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:28cb785d322c74b27864d651fd5c03324a13417b5c8e05ae7a9140dbeac4d170", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9b49272676ea0f30aec436137a5b9b645b0b31914bd60a9c7bf49214fd39edf1", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. The property of being\nquasi-DM over <MATH_0002>, quasi-separated over <MATH_0003>, or separated over <MATH_0004> (see\nDefinition <REF_0001>)\nis stable under change of base scheme, see\nAlgebraic Stacks, Definition <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:009a879e19cbf9e1a84eeb9d8795fb6edfa4d214b3cb418f980c023ef76f08dc", "unit_id": "tag:050G:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04YV", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-separated}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4667cdb9e484a462ef3e5d9f68781d4780f1e71c458d7effd4f2e096a8579946", "source_text": "Follows immediately from\nLemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9092c3bb1acd25e6f8d824b9a56f629884c7dd92490fcdf1d68c8ed81442e029", "unit_id": "tag:050G:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04YV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0002": "$g : \\mathcal{Y} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{T}$", "MATH_0004": "$i : \\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Z} \\mathcal{Y} \\to\n\\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{T} \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$i$", "MATH_0006": "$\\Delta_{\\mathcal{Z}/\\mathcal{T}}$", "MATH_0007": "$i$", "MATH_0008": "$\\Delta_{\\mathcal{Z}/\\mathcal{T}}$", "MATH_0009": "$i$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{T}$", "MATH_0011": "$i$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{T}$", "MATH_0013": "$i$", "MATH_0014": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{T}$", "MATH_0015": "$i$", "MATH_0016": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{T}$", "MATH_0017": "$i$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\item", "STRUCT_0007": "\\item", "STRUCT_0008": "\\item", "STRUCT_0009": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-fibre-product-after-map}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:af3012798d65598b5149fe04ea8a36637c49e2e77dbe3a2b0d245e2fb4ed338e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fb49356ca6c54ea6e2b8c95ae75fad6ab7e21bcd3af308b9194c1edc13083d35", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002>\nand <MATH_0003> be morphisms of algebraic stacks.\nConsider the induced morphism\n<MATH_0004>.\nThen\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0005> is representable by algebraic spaces and locally of finite type,\n<STRUCT_0003> if <MATH_0006> is quasi-separated, then\n<MATH_0007> is quasi-separated,\n<STRUCT_0004> if <MATH_0008> is separated, then\n<MATH_0009> is separated,\n<STRUCT_0005> if <MATH_0010> is DM,\nthen <MATH_0011> is unramified,\n<STRUCT_0006> if <MATH_0012> is quasi-DM,\nthen <MATH_0013> is locally quasi-finite,\n<STRUCT_0007> if <MATH_0014> is separated, then <MATH_0015> is proper, and\n<STRUCT_0008> if <MATH_0016> is quasi-separated, then\n<MATH_0017> is quasi-compact and quasi-separated.\n<STRUCT_0009>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a4e90ba6b9d39ede30f8e519f986cc251d812e5a50302dbeb7e727a35f55cef1", "unit_id": "tag:050H:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04YV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Z} \\mathcal{Y} \\ar[r]_i \\ar[d] &\n\\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{T} \\mathcal{Y} \\ar[d] \\\\\n\\mathcal{Z} \\ar[r]^-{\\Delta_{\\mathcal{Z}/\\mathcal{T}}} \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{T} \\mathcal{Z}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$2$", "MATH_0003": "$i$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Delta_{\\mathcal{Z}/\\mathcal{T}}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{categories-lemma-fibre-product-after-map}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-properties-diagonal}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8ca0d00874bbdaff9895d20e74a8b5278ba82e185d5a3b7e76c941658f37b721", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:388c58fc4eb6d4afcf1cc661e04c5f1d087835c463154126f87e2782698d10ac", "source_text": "The following diagram\n<MATH_0001>\nis a <MATH_0002>-fibre product diagram, see\nCategories, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nHence <MATH_0003> is the base change of the\ndiagonal morphism <MATH_0004>. Thus the lemma follows\nfrom\nLemma <REF_0002>,\nand the material in\nProperties of Stacks,\nSection <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:466870551332c53650a04ceea77349f26cd515b6ce1728e0c1cfe7a644b3840d", "unit_id": "tag:050H:proof"}
